Athanasius, Cyril, and John the Merciful,

738
00:58:17.740 --> 00:58:19.320
Patriarchs of Alexandria,

739
00:58:20.260 --> 00:58:22.300
Nicholas, Bishop of Myra,

740
00:58:22.460 --> 00:58:24.340
Spyridon, Bishop of Trimithus,

741
00:58:24.900 --> 00:58:26.760
Nectarios of Pendapolis,

742
00:58:27.060 --> 00:58:28.060
the Wonder Workers,

743
00:58:28.780 --> 00:58:29.960
the holy glory

744
00:58:30.000 --> 00:58:32.740
the glorious great martyrs, George the Triumphant,

745
00:58:33.640 --> 00:58:36.600
Demetrius the Merced Dreamer, Theodore the Soldier,

746
00:58:36.840 --> 00:58:39.340
Theodore the General, Minas the Wonder Worker,

747
00:58:39.920 --> 00:58:45.460
Haralumbos and Elephterios, the holy priest martyrs,

748
00:58:45.800 --> 00:58:48.520
the holy glorious and victorious martyrs,

749
00:58:48.720 --> 00:58:51.820
the glorious great martyr and all audible Ephemia,

750
00:58:52.280 --> 00:58:55.900
the holy and glorious martyrs, Thecla Barbara,

751
00:58:56.620 --> 00:58:58.680
Anastasia Catherine, Kyriakie,

752
00:58:58.800 --> 00:58:59.980
Fautini, Marina, Parasitia,

753
00:59:01.340 --> 00:59:03.920
our venerable and God-bearing fathers,

754
00:59:04.200 --> 00:59:07.220
the holy and righteous ancestors of God,

755
00:59:07.380 --> 00:59:10.480
Joachim and Anna, and the holy forefathers

756
