Lord, have mercy.

763
00:59:32.640 --> 00:59:37.660
Kyrie eleison, kyrie eleison, kyrie eleison.

764
00:59:38.180 --> 00:59:39.820
Lord, have mercy.

765
00:59:40.220 --> 00:59:41.720
Lord, have mercy.

766
00:59:42.240 --> 00:59:43.520
Lord, have mercy.

767
00:59:49.040 --> 00:59:53.680
Through the mercies, compassion, and love for humankind

768
